00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
¿No es genial?

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.640
I feel like I learned to fly

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:53.280
standing on shaky bridge.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.160
When I'm with you, I'm falling down.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.640
Oh, I forgot how to breathe.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:07.080
The abyss calling me.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:12.120
Whispering to me passionately.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.520
I don’t wanna wear a mask anymore.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.040
What have I been doing

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:21.480
here before you?

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:25.600
If I knew

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.520
That battle will be that much

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.440
worth to fight.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.160
I would do whatever anytime to...

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.840
Look at how perfect they are.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.720
They are practically made

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.680
for a magazine cover.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.240
I swear I do.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:08.080
Hey, give us a kiss for the crowd.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.640
Such a beautiful couple!

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:13.280
Kiss.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:14.920
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.200
What are we going to do now?

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.080
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.120
We’re going to be ourselves.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:21.320
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:30.600
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss.
